# {{ project_name }} Data Lab Functions

This directory contains the optional Data Lab Functions backend for {{ project_name }}.

The default entry notebook is `API.ipynb`.

Testing defaults:

- `python3 addon.py test --dir {{ dlf_path_override if dlf_path_override else 'data-lab-functions' }}` runs `unit` tests
- `python3 addon.py test --dir {{ dlf_path_override if dlf_path_override else 'data-lab-functions' }} --markers system` runs only `system` tests
- `python3 addon.py test --dir {{ dlf_path_override if dlf_path_override else 'data-lab-functions' }} --markers "unit or system"` runs both

Keep `API.ipynb` as route glue only. Put real logic in Python modules so unit and system tests can call the backend functions directly.
